Package: ladybug
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Embedded graph database command-line client
 Ladybug is an embedded graph database optimized for query speed and
 scalability.
 .
 This package provides the LadybugDB interactive shell command
 line client (lbug).

